                    hint_pricing:           `You cut the price but never re-ran the chain — margin is at 26%, runway at three months, and the ask is unchanged. Re-run margin → burn → runway → funding before the committee does it for you.`,
                    hint_positioning:       `The positioning–pricing contradiction is still live — it's the link the committee's red stamp is about. Repair it (premium or mass-market, not both) before anything else; no other fix outweighs it.`,
                    hint_verdict:           `You handed back a verdict, not a coherence map. Name the exact decisions that contradict each other — the committee funds fixes, not opinions.`,
